  "code" : "public int minEatingSpeed(int[] piles, int h) {\n    int max = 0;\n    for (int p : piles) max = Math.max(max, p);\n    int low = 1, high = max, ans = high;\n\n    while (low <= high) {\n        int mid = (low + high) / 2;\n        long hours = 0;\n        for (int p : piles) {\n            hours += (p + mid - 1) / mid;\n        }\n        if (hours <= h) {\n            ans = mid;\n            high = mid - 1;\n        } else {\n            low = mid + 1;\n        }\n    }\n    return ans;\n}",
